# Cloudflare Pages / Workers Single-Page Application (SPA) routing configuration
#
# Cloudflare Pages automatically serves /index.html with HTTP status 200 for all client-side
# routes (e.g. /services, /packages, /gallery, /contact-booking) when no 404.html is present.
#
# Explicit rules such as '/* /index.html 200' must NOT be used because Cloudflare's
# asset pipeline normalizes URLs by stripping '.html' and '/index', triggering deployment
# validation error 100324 ("Infinite loop detected in this rule").
